{
  "kind": "Panel",
  "spec": {
    "id": 102,
    "title": "Site visitors & engagement ${chart}",
    "description": "Per day (time ranges over 7 days): unique visitors to the whole site (Ghost's analytics, UTC days, from its first day with a visitor). The thin dashed line is each day's number, the bold one the 7-day average (of the days the bridge has among the 7 ending that day; it starts once 4 of them are there): the trend, through the day-to-day ups and downs. Magenta lines are Ghost posts, violet ones posts on the other networks (the network shows as a tag): a jump just after one is that post working, as on Growth's \"What moved your traffic\". Hour by hour (when the time range is 7 days or less): what came in between the bridge's checks (about once an hour; a point after a gap covers the gap), no 7-day line. Kept for the last 90 days (ACCOUNT_CHECK_DAYS); further back, pick per day. Both follow the dashboard's time range. Visitors come only per day, so the bridge keeps today's so far (UTC) at each check and the point is the difference; the first check after midnight counts from midnight. Engagement (blue) = what visitors did: new members, comments, clicks on links to other sites and plays on the LIVE NOW bar, added up (clicks and plays from when the theme started reporting them; comments from when the bridge started counting them); hover for each, and for the engagement rate: the 7 days' engagement per 100 of the 7 days' visitors. Engagement has its own scale, on the right: lines moving together = a steady rate; engagement rising faster = visitors doing more once they're here. Hour by hour has no rate.",
    "links": [],
    "data": {
      "kind": "QueryGroup",
      "spec": {
        "queries": [
          {
            "kind": "PanelQuery",
            "spec": {
              "query": {
                "kind": "DataQuery",
                "group": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "version": "v0",
                "datasource": {
                  "name": "bridge-instagram"
                },
                "spec": {
                  "columns": [
                    {
                      "selector": "date",
                      "text": "Date",
                      "type": "string"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "visitors",
                      "text": "Visitors",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "visitors7",
                      "text": "Visitors, 7-day average",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "engagement",
                      "text": "Engagement",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "engagement7",
                      "text": "Engagement, 7-day average",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "rate7",
                      "text": "Engagement rate, 7-day",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newMembers",
                      "text": "New members",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "newComments",
                      "text": "Comments",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "linkClicks",
                      "text": "Link clicks",
                      "type": "number"
                    },
                    {
                      "selector": "livePlays",
                      "text": "Live plays",
                      "type": "number"
                    }
                  ],
                  "filters": [],
                  "format": "table",
                  "parser": "backend",
                  "root_selector": "\"${chart}\" = \"hour by hour\" ? [] : daily",
                  "source": "url",
                  "type": "json",
                  "url": "http://postiz-ghost-bridge:8080/ghost.json",
                  "url_options": {
                    "data": "",
                    "method": "GET"
                  }
                }
              },
              "refId": "A",
              "hidden": false
            }
          },
          {
            "kind": "PanelQuery",
            "spec": {
              "query": {
                "kind": "DataQuery",
                "group": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
                "version": "v0",
                "datasource": {
                  "name": "bridge-instagram"
